<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Flowers Inds upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Flowers Inds upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it upgraded Flowers  Industries Inc to market outperformer from market performer.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- the stock was up 1/8 at 17-7/8.</p>
</text>
